        <name>include_row_ids</name>
        <qualifiedname>paimon::FullTextSearch::include_row_ids</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The row ids to search within, aligned with Java <computeroutput>includeRowIds</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The row id domain is determined by the reader: global row ids for <ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_global_index_reader" kindref="compound">GlobalIndexReader</ref> and physical file-local row ids for <ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_file_index_reader" kindref="compound">FileIndexReader</ref>. Only these rows are ranked, so an empty set matches no rows. If not set, all rows are searched. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
